        <mxCell id="RfqKmmUcTYStfmsyTsOJ-19" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Base Station Support&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;The application should support a wide variety of base stations that are providing data into the database.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;There should therefore be some abstraction of the individual base station characteristics to a generic interface.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Base stations may be low cost units such as uBlox or high end survey grade units such as Novatel.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
